  moveName: Cyclonic Sand Surge
  description: 'Forms a steerable sand tornado after 0.65s of protected preparation.
    Gains a shield equal to 15% of maximum HP and hindrance resistance while the
    tornado is active. Pulls opponents within 4m toward its core and knocks each
    opponent up at most once per cast, dealing damage when they land.

    The tornado lasts 6s. Power, pull strength, lift duration and movement speed
    gradually decrease after 3s, 4s and 5s. Recast to end early.
    When the tornado ends, Flygon gains 25% movement speed for 4s.'
